@@ -11,3 +11,9 @@ other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards
 Resolves an [RFC 6901 JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901) against a JSON document.
 The empty pointer returns the entire document. It throws when the pointer is malformed or does not
 identify a value in the document.
+
+### `applyPatch(document, patch)`
+
+Applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902) to a JSON document and
+returns a new document without mutating the input. Supports `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`,
+`copy`, and `test`; invalid patches and failed operations throw an error.
diff --git a/src/index.ts b/src/index.ts
